    "name": "IShardConnectionConfiguration",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "text",
    "contract": "IShardConnectionConfiguration is a provider-specific shard connection-configuration contract. An implementation exposes a writable 16-bit signed shard identifier and exposes its read and write IDataConnection values as read-only members; a caller using this interface may change the shard identifier but cannot replace either connection."
